CONCLUSION (a): timecodestamper embeds SMPTE timecode as video
buffer metadata (GstVideoTimeCode), and avwait consumes that
metadata to gate playback. Neither touches an audio buffer or
produces an LTC audio signal. No installed plugin (base/good/bad)
generates LTC audio. Candidate (a) is REJECTED on this image.

