CONCLUSION (b)/(c): Debian 13 ships libltc11/libltc-dev (the real
Manchester-biphase LTC encoder library, upstream x42/libltc), but no
prebuilt ltcgen/ltc-tools binary. This image compiles ltcgen.c
(candidate c: an external generator feeding the pipeline through
filesrc/fdsrc, built against libltc, not hand-rolled bit math) and
uses its output as candidate (b): a pre-rendered LTC file played
back as an ordinary source in the same pipeline as program. See
ltcgen.c and r2_alignment.sh / r3_ltc_generation.sh.

